{
  "$comment": "No-member-data contract on public Kit payloads: the one enumeration of every Kit GET and what its load data may carry. Public routes assert no Discord IDs/usernames, snowflakes, emails or session artifacts in __data/load payloads (suite below, hostile fixtures). Session-required routes keep their audited reads (negative controls). Hono-owned surfaces are out of scope (separate audit). ci/check-kit-payloads.mjs fails closed when a Kit server file is not classified here, so a new route cannot escape the contract by omission. Check IDs are stable: never reuse an ID for another route.",
  "contract": "no-member-data",
  "version": 1,
  "suite": "test/kit-no-member-data-contract.test.ts",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "kit-payload-detector",
      "route": null,
      "binding": null,
      "tests": ["no-member-data detector"],
      "note": "Detector unit pins: flags every planted needle plus the bearer shape, passes clean payloads; fixtures actually carry the needles."
    },
    {
      "id": "kit-payload-home",
      "route": "GET /",
      "binding": "web/src/routes/+page.server.ts",
      "tests": ["Kit GET / anonymous payload"]
    },
    {
      "id": "kit-payload-events",
      "route": "GET /events",
      "binding": "web/src/routes/events/+server.ts",
      "tests": ["Kit GET /events anonymous payload"]
    },
    {
      "id": "kit-payload-events-past",
      "route": "GET /events/past",
      "binding": "web/src/routes/events/past/+page.server.ts",
      "tests": ["Kit GET /events/past anonymous payload"]
    },
    {
      "id": "kit-payload-about",
      "route": "GET /about",
      "binding": "web/src/routes/about/+page.server.ts",
      "tests": ["Kit static-leaf anonymous payloads"]
    },
    {
      "id": "kit-payload-faq",
      "route": "GET /faq",
      "binding": "web/src/routes/faq/+page.server.ts",
      "tests": ["Kit static-leaf anonymous payloads"]
    },
    {
      "id": "kit-payload-rules",
